# SHA-256 of every single-mode render of testdata/bootstrap_render/main.tf,
# made with Terraform/templates/bootstrap.sh.tftpl as main had it at
# c9878073fb9c99029d8827bf96472e024a67e0ae.
# Nodes use user_data_replace_on_change, so a changed byte in a single render
# replaces every node of an existing cluster. TestBootstrapSingleRendersArePinned
# reads this file; split renders are not in it. Change a line only on purpose,
# from a render of main's template, never of the branch's.
# On purpose: joiner_join_firecracker (single Firecracker, jailer ids unset)
# changed when the bootstrap began to make the jailer's own system user
# instead of writing uid 1000. joiner_join_firecracker_own_ids (ids set to
# 1000) keeps the hash joiner_join_firecracker had at c9878073: a cluster
# that sets jailer_uid and jailer_gid to 1000 keeps its nodes.
